{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dash into action with Vector Strike, a competitive experience that blends precision shooting and an infinite skill cap with tense sports gameplay. It\u2019s easy to pick up but endlessly rewarding to master. Teamwork &amp; strategy reign supreme, so grab your squad &amp; score some goals.\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wishlist &amp; join us on our Early Access journey to help shape the future of Vector Strike!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/Heading-Next-Level-Physics.png?t=1741284228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/NextLevelPhysics.gif?t=1741284228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our physics engine delivers next-level ball control, making every shot, pass &amp; deflection feel real. Every action is skill-driven. Like real sports, perfect execution comes from practice, so refine your control, read the play &amp; land the shot when it matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/div.png?t=1741284228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/Heading-Choose-Your-Striker.png?t=1741284228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/Strikers-Steam.png?t=1741284228\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/MasterYourAbilities.gif?t=1741284228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pull off epic moves like double jumps, wall runs, slides and dashes to outmaneuver opponents. Choose your Striker from a diverse roster, each with unique abilities and movement options that open up new ways to play. Whether you dominate with precision, outthink with strategy, or thrive in pure chaos, there\u2019s a perfect Striker for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/div.png?t=1741284228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/Heading-Outplay.png?t=1741284228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/outplay-outscore-outsmart.gif?t=1741284228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Win your way. Score goals through strategic positioning, precise plays &amp; mastery of your Striker\u2019s unique abilities. Every match is a test of skill, strategy &amp; teamwork - adapt, read the game &amp; you\u2019ll be playing chess while they\u2019ll be playing checkers. In Vector Strike, victory comes from coordination &amp; strategy as a team, not elimination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/div.png?t=1741284228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/Heading-Squad-up.png?t=1741284228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/SquadUp.gif?t=1741284228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vector Strike is best played with friends. Jump into high-energy 4v4 matches solo or with up to three teammates - grind ranked or mess around in private lobbies. Face the world or keep it casual - either way, hit shareable moments &amp; have fun.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/div.png?t=1741284228\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/Heading-Community.png?t=1741284228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add Vector Strike to your wishlist, join our Discord community to find people to play with &amp; follow us across our socials! That\u2019s where we\u2019ll drop all the latest updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See you on the pitch ;)\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2678820?t=1741284228","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2678820?t=1741284228","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/2397a7484731ce7b8731af04c07d690c4eb2a2a9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741284228","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/2397a7484731ce7b8731af04c07d690c4eb2a2a9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741284228","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dash into action with Vector Strike, a competitive experience that blends precision shooting and an infinite skill cap with tense sports gameplay. It\u2019s easy to pick up but endlessly rewarding to master. Teamwork &amp; strategy reign supreme, so grab your squad &amp; score some goals.\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wishlist &amp; join us on our Early Access journey to help shape the future of Vector Strike!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/Heading-Next-Level-Physics.png?t=1741284228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/NextLevelPhysics.gif?t=1741284228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our physics engine delivers next-level ball control, making every shot, pass &amp; deflection feel real. Every action is skill-driven. Like real sports, perfect execution comes from practice, so refine your control, read the play &amp; land the shot when it matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/div.png?t=1741284228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/Heading-Choose-Your-Striker.png?t=1741284228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/Strikers-Steam.png?t=1741284228\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/MasterYourAbilities.gif?t=1741284228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pull off epic moves like double jumps, wall runs, slides and dashes to outmaneuver opponents. Choose your Striker from a diverse roster, each with unique abilities and movement options that open up new ways to play. Whether you dominate with precision, outthink with strategy, or thrive in pure chaos, there\u2019s a perfect Striker for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/div.png?t=1741284228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/Heading-Outplay.png?t=1741284228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/outplay-outscore-outsmart.gif?t=1741284228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Win your way. Score goals through strategic positioning, precise plays &amp; mastery of your Striker\u2019s unique abilities. Every match is a test of skill, strategy &amp; teamwork - adapt, read the game &amp; you\u2019ll be playing chess while they\u2019ll be playing checkers. In Vector Strike, victory comes from coordination &amp; strategy as a team, not elimination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/div.png?t=1741284228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/Heading-Squad-up.png?t=1741284228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/SquadUp.gif?t=1741284228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vector Strike is best played with friends. Jump into high-energy 4v4 matches solo or with up to three teammates - grind ranked or mess around in private lobbies. Face the world or keep it casual - either way, hit shareable moments &amp; have fun.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/div.png?t=1741284228\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/Heading-Community.png?t=1741284228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add Vector Strike to your wishlist, join our Discord community to find people to play with &amp; follow us across our socials! That\u2019s where we\u2019ll drop all the latest updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See you on the pitch ;)\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Chamo Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/header.jpg?t=1741284228","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Copyright 2025 Chamo Games. Developed by Chamo Games. Published by Chamo Games. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257096303,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257096303/movie480.mp4?t=1739178243","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257096303/movie_max.mp4?t=1739178243"},"name":"Vector Strike Gameplay Global Announcement","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257096303/7ff7a9f7934391282c0451fa7ecd4edf71c82dd8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1739178243","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257096303/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1739178243","max":"http://video.ak